  "discussion": "Reporting cybersecurity incidents to the chief information security officer, or one of their delegates, as soon as possible after they occur or are discovered provides senior management with the opportunity to assess the impact to their organisation and to oversee any cybersecurity incident response activities. Note, an organisation should also be cognisant of any legislative obligations regarding the reporting of cybersecurity incidents to authorities.",
